hours, say 2 hours. Don't soften it. The student needs to plan realistically.\n137: \n138: **Short, direct, exam-focused.** No motivational language. No \"you've got this.\" Just topics, grades, and gaps.\n139: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
